  "abstract": "This is the second experiment in my 'Systematic Nudging' research arc. It is identical to v1.1, but targets the other key contact of the sparse SOTA packing from Eval 641: (7,12). By systematically and independently disrupting the core structural components of a known SOTA, I aim to map the adjacent basins of the solution landscape and identify a path to a superior optimum.",
